<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Iacov</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola al Iacov</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iacov</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iac</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola al Iacov</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Iacovul, huzmichearlu al Dumnidzãu sh-al Domnul Isus Hristos, cãtrã atselji doisprãdzatsi fãri arãspãnditi tu dunjeauã Sãnãtati!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Fratsi sh-surãri a meali, s-lugursits ca mari harauã cãndu vã ncuntreadzã cu cãrteari soi di soi, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />cã voi u shtits cã prova a pistiljei a voastrã va s-aducã arãvdarea. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Shi arãvdarea la voi s-mplineascã lucrul a ljei, tsi sh-voi s-hits perfectsã sh-ntredzi, shi s-nu vã lipseascã tsiva. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Macã a vãrui di voi lj-lipseashti mintimeniljea, s-lji caftã a Dumnidzãlui cai da a tutulor fãrã icunumii sh-fãrã vãrghiri, sh-Dumnidzãlu a lui va lji da. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ma elu prindi s-u caftã cu pisti sh-fãrã ãndoiri, cã atsel tsi ãndoiashti easti ca vãljuri a amariljei, sculat shi plãscãnit dit vimtul. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Atsel om nu prindi s-ashteaptã s-ljea tsiva di la Domnul. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Ahtari om easti cu doauã minti shi ni-stabilizat tu itsido tsi fatsi. <verse eid="JAS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Fratili shi sora ni-avut s-hãrseascã, cã Dumnidzãlu va lji analtã, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />iarã avutlu va s-apunã, cã va s-treacã ca lilicea a iarbãljei. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Cum si scoalã soarili cu cãldura a lui shi ardi iarba, sh-lilicea si usucã shi mushãteatsa a ljei cheari, ashãtsi va s-treacã shi avutlu prit lucrili a lui. <verse eid="JAS 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Ca hara di atsel om tsi aravdã prova, cã cãndu ari tricut prova, va s-arãsplãteascã cu curuna a banãljei, tsi Domnul lã u tãxi atsilor tsi l-u vor. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Vãrã cãndu easti cãrtit, s-nu dzãc cã easti cãrtit di la Dumnidzãlu, cã elu nu poati s-cãrteascã di arãulu, shi Dumnidzãlu nu cãrteashti vãrã. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ma caitsido s-cãrteashti di orixea a lui tsi u tradzi sh-u arãdi. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Dupã atsea, orixea cãndu s-ngarcã, amintã amãrtii, sh-amãrtia cãndu s-fatsi, adutsi moartea. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />S-nu vã arãdets, frats sh-surãri a melji multu vruts. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Itsi bunãtati sh-itsi doarã perfectu yini di nsus sh-dipuni di la Tatãl a lunjinãljei, tsi nu alãxeashti sh-nu ari aumbrã di alãxiri tu nãsu. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Elu aleapsi s-nã amintã prit zborlu a alihiljei, tsi noi ashã s-him ca protlu frut a adãrãturilor a lui.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Tora frats sh-surãri a meali multu vruts: Cathiunu s-hibã etimu tu ascultari, misurat tu greari, shi amãnat tu nãriri. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Cã omlu cu inatea a lui nu mplineashti ndriptatea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Trã atsea, arucats nclo itsi lãvushiturã sh-itsi arãutati altã, aprucheats-lu cu aplicãciuni zborlu a Dumnidzãlui siminat la voi, tsi poati s-ascapã suflitli a voastri. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Fãtsets-vã fãcãtori a zborlui, sh-nu singur ascultãtori tsi s-arãd elji idyi. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Macã un easti ascultãtor a zborlui sh-nu fãcãtor a zborlui, elu undzeashti cu un om tsi mutreashti fatsa a lui tu cutii, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />shi dupã tsi u mutreashti, fudzi sh-troarã agãrshashti cum eara. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ma atsel tsi u veadi cu cãshtigã mari legea perfectã a libertatiljei sh-u tsãni tu nãsu, nu ca vãrã ascultãtor tsi agãrshashti, ma ca mplinitor a ljei, elu va hibã ghinicuvintat tu lucrarea a lui. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Macã vãrã mindueashti cã easti pistimen sh-nu poati s-u ncljidã gura, arãdi inima a lui, sh-pistea a lui easti digeaba. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Religia curatã shi nilãvushitã nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, Tatãl easti aestã: cãshtigarea trã oarfãnjlji, trã veduvili tu taxirãtsili a lor, shi vigljearea curat a banãljei di lumea.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tsãnearea cu Hãtãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Frats sh-surãri a melji pistimenji tu Domnul a nostru mãritu, Isus Hristos, s-nu tsãnets cu hãtãri. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Macã un om intrã tu adunãrili a voastri cu un nelu di furii shi stranji scumpi, sh-un om niavut cu stranji lãvushiti, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />sh-voi lj-bãgats oarã atsilui om cu stranji scumpi shi lj-dzãtsets: “Tini apunãti aoa, tu loclu ma bun,” shi a niavutlui lj-dzãtsets: “Tini shedz aclo pi cicioari,” icã: “Apunãti aclo mpadi, la cicioarili a meali,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />nu avets faptã diferentsã namisa di voi, fãcãnda ashã ca giudicãtori cu minduiri arali? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Ascultats, frats sh-surãri a melji vruts! Nu lji aleapsi Dumnidzãlu niavutsilji a lumiljei tra s-hibã avuts tu pisti sh-mushtinitori a amirãriljei, tsi elu lã-u tãxi atsilor tsi lu vor? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ma voi nu lu avets tinjisit niavutlu. Nu suntu avutslji atselji tsi vã domneascã sh-vã tragã azvara tu giudicatã? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Nu suntu atselji tsi blastimã numa atsea buna atsilui tsi vã acljimã? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Macã mplinits legea amirãreascã dupã Scritura: “Su vrei aproapilu a tãu ca cum ti vrei tini,” ma fãtsets ghini. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ma macã fãtsets diferentsã, voi fãtsets amãrtii sh-legea vã condamnã ca cãlcãtor di lege. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Caitsido tsi respecteadzã tutã legea, ma u-calcã tu un singur ordin, s-fatsi cãbatar la tuti. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Cã atsel tsi dzãsi: “S-nu caltsi curuna,” tutashã dzãsi: “S-nu vatsãnji.” Trã atsea, macã tini nu u caltsã curuna, ma tini vatsãnj, tini eshti cãlcãtor a legiljei. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Trã atsea si zburãts shi s-fãtsets ca atselji tsi va hibã giudicats dit legea tsi da libertati. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Cã giudicata va hibã fãrã njilã di atsel tsi nu ari aspusã njilã. Sh-njila amintã pristi giudicata.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistea sh-Faptili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Tsi bunã easti, frats sh-surãri a melji, macã un dzãtsi cã ari pisti, ma nu ari fapti? Poati elu s-ascapã cu aestã pisti? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Sh-macã un frati icã unã sorã va hibã disvãscuts shi lipseashti mãcarea di cathi dzuã, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />shi un di voi lã dzãtsi a lor: “Adutsets-vã tu pace! Ncãldzãts-vã shi fãnãtits-vã!”, sh-nu lã da a lor lucrili di cai elji au ananghi ti truplu, tsi hãiri ari? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Tutashã pistea, macã nu ari fapti, easti moartã tu nãsã. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ma un altu dzãtsi: “Tini ai pisti, ma mini am faptili.” Aspunã-nji a njia, cã macã vãrã poati s-aibã pisti fãrã fapti sh-mini va sã aspunã pistea a mea cu faptili a meali. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Tini pistipseashti cã ari un Dumnidzã. Ghini fats! Demonjlji pistipsescu shi s-cutreamburã. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Vrei tini provã, om gol, cã pistea fãrã fapti easti moartã? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Abrahamul, tatãl a nostru, nu s-ndriptã prit faptili a lui, cãndu lu bãgã pri altar hiljiu a lui, Isac? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Tini vedz cã pistea lucra deadun cu faptili, shi prit faptili pistea a lui s-featsi perfectã. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ashã si mplini Scritura tsi dzãtsi: “Abrahamul lj-pistipsi a Dumnidzãlui shi aestã lji si lugursi ca ndreptati.” Elu s-acljimã oaspilu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Voi videts tsi un om s-ndripteadzã prit faptili sh-nu mash prit pistea. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Tutashã, sh-putana Rahaba, nu s-ndriptã sh-ea di faptili a ljei, cãndu lji ashtiptã pitricutslji shi li cãlãuzi tu unã altã cali? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Cã, ashã cum truplu fãrã duh easti mortu, ashã sh-pistea fãrã fapti easti moartã.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Imiripsirea a Limbãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Frats sh-surãri, nu vã fãtsets mults di voi nvitsãtori, shtinda cã va lom unã giudicatã ma aspru. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Noi tuts alãtipsim tu multi lucri. Macã tsiniva nu alãtipseashti tu zbor, atumtsea elu easti un om perfectu sh-axiu ti domniri tut truplu a lui. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Cãndu noi bãgãm fãrnul tu gura a caljilor, tra s-nã avdu, ndriptãmu ashã tut truplu a lor. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Videts sh-pamporlji, cu tut cã suntu ahãnti mãri shi s-pingu di vimturi vãrtoasi, s-ndripteadzã di un timon njic aclo iu va timonierlu. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ashã sh-limba easti parti njicã a truplui, ma s-alavdi multu. Ia, un foc njic aprindi un pãduri mari. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Sh-limba easti foc, lumea a nindriptatiljei. Limba easti bãgat namisa di mãdularili a truplui, lãvusheashti tut truplu, aprindi roata a banãljei shi s-aprindi di Gehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Cã itsi agrimii, pulji, azvãrnitori shi creaturi a amariljei suntu imiripsitã shi sumbãgati di fara umineascã, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />ma limba vãrã om nu poati su imiripseascã. Ea easti un arãu disfãrnat, mplinã di fãrmac tsi adutsi moarti. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Cu limba noi ghinicuvãntãm Domnul shi Tatãl, sh-cu atsea noi blãstimãm oaminjlji cai suntu fapts dupã undzearea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Di unã gurã easi ghinicuvintarea sh-blãstimarea. Frats sh-surãri a melji, nu prindi s-eara ashã. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Poati dit un izvur s-easã sh-apã dultsi sh-apã amarã? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Poati hiclu s-facã masni, icã yita hits? Ashã, nu poati un izvur cu apã sãratã s-da apã dultsi.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Doauã Soi di Mintimenilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Cai di voi easti mintimen shi shtiut? S-li aspunã cu purtari mushatã faptili a lui, cu inimã fronimã tsi yini di mintimeniljea. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Macã tu ininjli a voastri avets zilii amarã shi ambitsii egoistã, nu vã alãvdats sh-nu alipidats alihea. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Atsea mintimenilji nu yini di nsus, ma easti a loclui, easti nisufliteascã shi diavuleascã. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Cã aclo iu ari zilii shi ambitsii egoistã, aclo ari mintiturã sh-soi di soi di lucri arãi. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ma mintimeniljea tsi yini dit nsus prota easti curatã, deapoea puituitã, moali, ascultãtoarã, mplinã di njilã sh-cu fruti buni, fãrã-hãtãri sh-fãrã-ipucrizii. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Frutlu a ndriptatiljei si seaminã cu pace di atselji tsi fac pacea.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Oaspi cu Lumea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Di iu yin alumtili shi ncãcearili la voi? Nu yin dit orixili tsi alumtã nãuntru tu mãdularili a voastri? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Voi vrets sh-nu avets, voi vãtãmats sh-avets zilii sh-nu amintats tsiva. Voi vã ncãceats sh-alumtats, ma nu avets, cã nu cãftats di la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Voi cãftats sh-nu loats, cã cãftats cu nãeti arãu tra s-li ufilisits ti chehili a voastri. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Cãlcãtori a curuniljei, nu shtits cã uspitsãljea cu lumea easti tu dushmãnlichi cu Dumnidzãlu? Atsel tsi va hibã oaspi cu lumea easti dushman a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Voi minduits cã Scritura greashti digeaba: “Duhlu tsi Dumnidzãlu l-bãgã tu noi, si zilipseashti ti noi.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ma elu da har sh-ma multu, trã atsea s-dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“Dumnidzãlu li ncuntreadzã mintimãrlji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">sh-lã da har a aplicatsilji.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Prov 3:34</char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Sumbãgats-vã a Dumnidzãlui, ncuntrats-vã a draclui sh-elu va s-dipãrteadzã di voi. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Aprucheats-vã di Dumnidzãlu sh-elu va s-aproachi di voi. Curats mãnjili a voastri voi amãrtioshi, shi sãmtsãsits ininjli, oaminji cu doauã minti! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Nvirinats-vã, jilits sh-plãndzets. Arãslu a vostru s-toarnã tu jali, sh-hãrsirea tu nvirinari. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Aplicats-vã nãintea a Domnului, sh-elu va s-vã analtsã. <verse eid="JAS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Frats sh-surãri a melji, nu zburãts arãu ti un-alantu. Atsel tsi greashti arãu ti fratili icã ti sora a lui, greashti contra a legiljei sh-lu giudicã legea. Sh-ma s-giuditsi legea, tini nu eshti fãcãtor a legiljei, ma un giudicãtor. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Singur un easti Dãtãtor sh-Giudicãtor, atsel tsi poati s-ti ascapã icã s-ti chearã. Ma tini cai eshti tsi giuditsi aproapilu a tãu?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alãvdarea ti Mãni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Tora ascultats, voi tsi dzãtsets: “Azã icã mãni noi va nidzem tu aestu icã tu alantu cãsãbã, va armãnem un an aclo, va fãtsem pãzari sh-va amintãm pãradzi.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Voi nu shtits cã tsi va hibã dzua di mãni. Tsi easti bana a voastrã? Atsea easti ca un abur tsi s-veadi di putsãn chiro sh-deapoea cheari. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Voi prindi s-dzãtsets: “Ma s-va Domnul, atumtsea va bãnãm sh-va fãtsem aestã icã alanta.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Voi vã alãvdats cu fuduleatsa a voastrã. Cathi ahtar alãvdari easti arauã. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Atsel tsi shti s-fac ghineatsã sh-nu u fatsi, elu amãrtiseashti.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Condamna a Avutsãlor Arãi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Tora voi avuts, plãndzets sh-vãitats, ti taxiratea tsi ma yini pristi voi. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Ayishtearea a voastrã s-putridzã shi stranjili a voastri li mãcã molitsa. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Furia sh-asimea a voastrã s-arudzinarã. Arudzina a lor va hibã mãrtirii contra voi sh-va mãcã carnea a voastra ca foclu. Voi avets adunat ayishteari tu dzãlili di soni. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Mutrits, plata tsi lj-avets tsãnut a lucrutorlor tsi sitsirarã cãmpurili a voastri, ma aurlã contra voi. Aurlãrili a sitsirãtorilor au agiumtã la urecljili a Domnului Puternic. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Aoa tu loc bãnat tu luxu sh-tu chefi. Voi li avets hrãnit ininjli a voastri ti dzua a tãljeariljei. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Voi avets cãtãdzicãsit sh-avets vãtãmat ndreptulu, tsi nu vã ncuntrã.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arãvdari tu Dureari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Frats sh-surãri, arãvdats pãnã s-yinã Domnul. Ia, agricultorlu ashteapti cu arãvdari carpolu atsel scumpu a loclui pãnã s-da ploaili di ma nãinti sh-di ma nãpoi <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Voi tutashã s-avets arãvdari shi nvãrtushits-lã ininjli a voastri, cã vinita a Domnului easti aproapi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Frats shi surãri, nu murmurats contra un-alantu, tra s-nu vã giudicats. Giudicãtorlu ma sta nãinti di ushã. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Frats sh-surãri a melji, loats ca exemplu arãvdarea sh-munduirea a prufitsilor, tsi grirã tu numa a Domnului. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ascultats! Noi lã acljimãm ghinicuvintats atselji tsi arãvdarã. Voi avets avdzãtã di arãvdarea al Iob sh-vidzum tsi lji featsi Domnul tu soni. Domnul easti multu-durut sh-mplinã di njilã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Iob 1:21</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Ps 103:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Frats sh-surãri, nãinti di tuti nu vã spigiurats nitsi pri tserlu sh-nitsi pri loclu, sh-nu fãtsets altã spigiurari. Ma, s-hibã “Ie” di “Ie” sh-“Nu” di “Nu,” tra s-nu cãdets sum condamnã.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rugãciunea cu Pisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Macã s-mundueashti vãrã di voi, si-s roagã. Macã vãrã easti hãros, s-cãntã cãntitsi di alãvdari. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Macã vãrã di voi easti lãndzit, s-acljeamã aushlji a bisearicãljei tra s-facã rugãciuni pristi nãsu sh-deapoea s-lu aungã cu untulem tu numa a Domnului. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Rugarea cu pisti va l-vindicã atsel tsi easti lãndzit sh-Domnul va lu scoalã. Ma s-aibã faptã amãrtii, elu va si s-ljeartã. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Trã atsea, spunets amãrtiili la un-alantu, sh-rugats-vã trã un-alantu tra s-vã vindicats. Multã fuchii ari rugãciunea a ndreptului. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elia eara un om ca noi. Elu s-rugã cu tut suflit s-nu dãdea ploai sh-nu deadi ploai pristi loc di trei anji shi shasi meshi. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Deapoea s-rugã nãpoi sh-tserlu deadi ploai sh-loclu deadi frutili a lui. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Frats sh-surãri, macã vãrã di voi s-dipãrteadzi di alihea sh-un altã lu toarni, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />si shtits cã: caitsido tsi va toarnã un amãrtios di chirearea a caliljei, va s-ascapã di moarti sh-va s-anvãleascã unã multsãmi di amãrtii.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>